# Freshy | contribution and writing standards

This file is a bridge only. Read [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) before editing this repo: it is the single entry point for Freshy's own policy (language, naming, code style, testing, PR requirements, local setup). Generic engineering practice (TDD, git workflow, commit format, review, naming, writing style) lives in the shared [.guidelines/](../../.guidelines/) submodule, indexed from [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

Do not add rules here; add them to `CONTRIBUTING.md` or the relevant `.guidelines/` file instead.
